  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "じめじめした　もりのなかで　くらす。はがれおちた　からだの　ヒラヒラははごたえがあって　とても　おいしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "축축한 숲속에 산다. 떨어져 나온 몸의 하늘하늘한 부분은 쫄깃쫄깃하고 아주 맛있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在潮濕的森林裡。從身體上剝落的薄片富有嚼勁，極為美味。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit dans les forêts humides. La partie ondulée qui entoure son abdomen peut se détacher. Elle est croquante et délicieuse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in feuchten Wäldern. Die Falten, die sich von seinem Körper lösen, sind gummiartig und sehr schmackhaft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los pliegues ondulados que se desprenden de su cuerpo cuentan con una textura curiosa y un sabor delicioso. Habita en bosques húmedos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive in foreste umide. Le pieghe ondulate che si staccano dal suo corpo hanno una consistenza gommosa e un ottimo sapore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Toedscool lives in muggy forests. The flaps that fall from its body are chewy and very delicious.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "じめじめした　森の中で　暮らす。剥がれ落ちた　体の　ヒラヒラは歯ごたえがあって　とても　美味しい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栖息在潮湿的森林里。它身上脱落的薄片富有嚼劲，非常美味。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los pliegues ondulados que se desprenden de su cuerpo cuentan con una textura curiosa y un sabor delicioso. Habita en bosques húmedos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "メノクラゲに　にているが　まったくべつの　しゅるい。　あしは　ほそいがはしりだせば　じそく５０キロになる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "왕눈해를 닮았지만 전혀 다른 종류다. 다리는 가늘지만 달리기 시작하면 시속 50km에 이르게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看起來像瑪瑙水母，其實是截然不同的種類。雖然腳很細，但跑起來能達到時速５０公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Tentacool, mais il n’en est pas un. Malgré leur finesse, ses pattes lui permettent de courir à une vitesse de 50 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Obwohl es wie ein Tentacha aussieht, handelt es sich um eine völlig andere Art. Seine Beine sind dünn, aber es kann bis zu 50 km/h schnell laufen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda cierto parecido con los Tentacool, pero son dos especies no relacionadas. Sus delgadas extremidades le permiten alcanzar los 50 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia a Tentacool, ma in realtà si tratta di una specie di Pokémon completamente diversa. Ha gambe sottili, ma può raggiungere i 50 km/h.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though it looks like Tentacool, Toedscool is a completely different species. Its legs may be thin, but it can run at a speed of 30 mph.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "メノクラゲに　似ているが　まったく別の　種類。　脚は　細いが走りだせば　時速５０キロになる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看起来像玛瑙水母，其实是截然不同的种类。虽然脚很细，但是跑起来能达到时速５０公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda cierto parecido con los Tentacool, pero son dos especies no relacionadas. Sus delgadas extremidades le permiten alcanzar los 50 km/h.",
      "language": {
